      "text": "Heights of Gilead. A city of refuge, and (under Solomon) the seat of the governor of a province. Probably the most important Israelite city east of Jordan; identified with the modern Es Salt. See 1 Kgs. 4:13; 22; 2 Kgs. 8:28; 9:1, 4, 14; 2 Chr. 18; 22:5.",
